{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas","id":1387122,"title":"Cool familiar ideas!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-09T17:10:21-07:00","id":1387122,"title":"Cool familiar ideas!","content":"In another thread I made a DB with familiar charms, and I'm wondering what cool ideas for familiars people have.<br /> <br /> I've been meaning to look back in old 2e and 1e books for interesting Exalted fauna, or maybe read a Last Airbender wiki or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T19:07:28-07:00","id":1387152,"title":"","content":"My seafaring game had two PCs with Familiars - one was a horse-sized hunting hound bred in the kennels of Yu-Shan, with eyes like starry night; the other was a Lethe serpent, a ghostly snake whose venom caused memory loss (and was thus especially dangerous to the dead).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T22:55:56-07:00","id":1387192,"title":"","content":"I had one player with a God-Blooded stallion son of Hiparkes as a familiar/mount. It was basically a Horse++ that could be revived by praying at its shrine and making an offering.<br /> <br /> On a different game I had a pair of Wood Aspect antagonists, one of which was a ranger-type with an eagle familiar, who gave the party a massive headache. The familiar scouted and kept tabs on the party, meaning they could always stay one step ahead and avoid the direct confrontation the players wanted, while the other Wood Aspect, a sorceress, could continuously ambush them with elementals.<br /> <br /> Currently I'm playing as a Lunar sorceress and early on I summoned a Greenmaw that decided to stick around. I've been giving it mutations and powers through workings and lunar charms and feeding it the corpses of my enemies. Now its the size of a castle, has wings and breathes poison and has built itself a nest out the remains of an entire fleet or Realm warships.<br /> <br /> He's adorable. I call him Leafy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T12:22:59-07:00","id":1387309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BadassOverlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1387192#post1387192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had one player with a God-Blooded stallion son of Hiparkes as a familiar/mount. It was basically a Horse++ that could be revived by praying at its shrine and making an offering.<br /> <br /> On a different game I had a pair of Wood Aspect antagonists, one of which was a ranger-type with an eagle familiar, who gave the party a massive headache. The familiar scouted and kept tabs on the party, meaning they could always stay one step ahead and avoid the direct confrontation the players wanted, while the other Wood Aspect, a sorceress, could continuously ambush them with elementals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice, I was thinking of grabbing an eagle myself (or a re-fluffed exalted-y eagle) for scouting purposes, sounds like it was handy! My one concern was it getting shot out of the sky.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BadassOverlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1387192#post1387192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Currently I'm playing as a Lunar sorceress and early on I summoned a Greenmaw that decided to stick around. I've been giving it mutations and powers through workings and lunar charms and feeding it the corpses of my enemies. Now its the size of a castle, has wings and breathes poison and has built itself a nest out the remains of an entire fleet or Realm warships.<br /> <br /> He's adorable. I call him Leafy.</div> </div> </div> </div>These are now my familiar goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T14:52:01-07:00","id":1387332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tumbleweed664</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1387309#post1387309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nice, I was thinking of grabbing an eagle myself (or a re-fluffed exalted-y eagle) for scouting purposes, sounds like it was handy! My one concern was it getting shot out of the sky.</div> </div> </div> </div>If your pet's high up enough, this is harder than it sounds. If the bird's past a certain range, it takes a full turn of aiming first before an attack can be made (absent Charms anyway). And if the pet's past a certain range past that, an attack might not be able to be made <i>at all</i> (absent Charms anyway).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T11:32:27-07:00","id":1387551,"title":"","content":"Fogshark.<br /> I have the persistent idea of making at some point a sorcerer with a fogshark familiar and Mists of Eventide as her control spell, and investing a lot of time and effort to allow her fogshark to come out whenever she wants, and with the long-term project of having her own mist-covered kingdom full of fogsharks.<br /> I can't manage to make up my mind on the rest of her character, but I'm gonna have that fogshark elemental eventually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T11:43:41-07:00","id":1387555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChairKicker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1387551#post1387551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fogshark.<br /> I have the persistent idea of making at some point a sorcerer with a fogshark familiar and Mists of Eventide as her control spell, and investing a lot of time and effort to allow her fogshark to come out whenever she wants, and with the long-term project of having her own mist-covered kingdom full of fogsharks.<br /> I can't manage to make up my mind on the rest of her character, but I'm gonna have that fogshark elemental eventually.</div> </div> </div> </div>Deadly Sharknado Technique.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T09:23:49-07:00","id":1388344,"title":"","content":"Sky Titan is the best familiar, 3 dots in 3e gets you this maginificent gigantosaur to impress your friends and terrify your enemies.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BHn0tFn.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8877-mrfamiliar","name":"MrFamiliar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T11:27:10-07:00","id":1388367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrFamiliar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1388344#post1388344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sky Titan is the best familiar, 3 dots in 3e gets you this maginificent gigantosaur to impress your friends and terrify your enemies.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BHn0tFn.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>YES! Showing up to the Mnemon gala on that. &quot;Ugh, the Cynis Greyfalls satrap is here.&quot;<br /> <br /> You have lived up to your name, Mr Familiar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T11:48:43-07:00","id":1388376,"title":"","content":"Gracious Pealing Melody has a Shieldback Lizard called Clapper. He is, as I believe the kids are saying, a chonky boi. The one time we rolled him into combat literally nothing could hurt him.<br /> <br /> Mnemon Alinos Danireya has a summoned Greenmaw that she treats like a pet dog and may well become a Familiar. Use in combat has been kinda &quot;meh&quot;, but use of Introduce a Fact combined with Social rolls has been very useful.<br /> <br /> Urza Arcus (NPC Lunar) had an Eagle familiar. Just an ordinary Eagle Familiar. It was a pretty terrifying opponent until Cynis Ganan Clashed it with a Grapple and crushed it to death with his bare hands.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrFamiliar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1388344#post1388344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sky Titan is the best familiar, 3 dots in 3e gets you this maginificent gigantosaur to impress your friends and terrify your enemies.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BHn0tFn.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Which book/page?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T12:01:22-07:00","id":1388380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1388376#post1388376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which book/page?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's one of the Hundred Devil Night Parade entries.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I had an idea once that I never got to actually play where a water aspected deep sea archeologist kept a glowing extra intelligent cuttlefish with him, in a jar of magically fresh seawater if he had to go on land for a while. Using him as a friendly bright lantern that needs to flame and works underwater. He met the fish while on a super deep sea dive into inky blackness, unbeknownst to him a massive deep sea predator was stalking him in the dark, and his new glowing friend both warned him of the impending danger and lit up the area bright enough to find his way out and escape.<br /> <br /> He also slept on his ship in a literal water bed, using his anima power to sleep submerged with the little cuddlefish wrapped up in his fingers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T13:06:36-07:00","id":1388404,"title":"","content":"Hundred Devil's Night Parade adds some pretty cool entries to the familiar roster. We now have familiar hawks statted at all three levels, lol. The judgmental, perfection-obsessed unicorns are cool but scary and the elephant mammoth is nice for an example 3 dot familiar that is on the mundane side. The magic singing giant grosbeak is nice as an example of a non-mount 3 dot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T13:16:24-07:00","id":1388405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tumbleweed664</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1388404#post1388404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hundred Devil's Night Parade adds some pretty cool entries to the familiar roster. We now have familiar hawks statted at all three levels, lol. The judgmental, perfection-obsessed unicorns are cool but scary and the elephant mammoth is nice for an example 3 dot familiar that is on the mundane side. The magic singing giant grosbeak is nice as an example of a non-mount 3 dot.</div> </div> </div> </div>And lest we forget; for the anathema who wants to make a statement, and that statement is &quot;lmao f**k the Wyld Hunt, come at me&quot;, there's the ever popular Mouse of the Sun. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2IjMqj7.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> I do love a Unicorn too. +5 Speed bonus is no joke. I can't wait until they release the compilation book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8877-mrfamiliar","name":"MrFamiliar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T13:31:00-07:00","id":1388413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrFamiliar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1388405#post1388405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And lest we forget; for the anathema who wants to make a statement, and that statement is &quot;lmao f**k the Wyld Hunt, come at me&quot;, there's the ever popular Mouse of the Sun.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2IjMqj7.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> I do love a Unicorn too. +5 Speed bonus is no joke. I can't wait until they release the compilation book.</div> </div> </div> </div>The mice are really fun. I had a 2e night who had a mouse of the sun, the abu to his aladdin. I'm thinking of trying to do some kind of reskin of them for my upcoming DB survival character, maybe make them fire-aspect or make the poison into a wood-aspect thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T23:00:41-07:00","id":1388576,"title":"","content":"I want these cuties<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.sadanduseless.com/shark-cats-gallery/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.sadanduseless.com/shark-cats-gallery/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.sadanduseless.com/shark-cats-gallery/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.sadanduseless.com/shark-cats-gallery/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T01:37:21-07:00","id":1388600,"title":"","content":"My circle has a Twilight Survival Supernal with an Otter familiar. Originally he used the Great Cat statblock except he switched out Keen Smell for Swim Speed. Then the Survival charms came rolling in and now its a Terrifying God Otter with the stats of a Tyrant Lizard that can do Water Magic and has its own Cult **. His name is Meat Buns (because he's from Wu-Jian). Meat Buns also has a floating scarf type thing that it controls with its essence (perfect for grapples)<br /> <br /> The Party then decided that the best thing to do on the Caul while assisting said Twilight's Lunar Wife hunt and kill a Tyrant Lizard to gain its power was to browbeat and tame a juvenile Tyrant Lizard so they could <i>start an Exalted Jurassic Park</i>. So that;s how we have the <b>Pup</b>. This is why I drink.<br /> <br /> The other Twilight has a trained Crow named <b>Crowley</b>, who can turn invisible and share his sight and hearing with his master. Crowley has seen so many Glorious Powerful Lunar Bird Forms that it has sunk deep into Avian Depression. It literally looks at the other Lunar on board the ship and goes &quot;<i>caw.... caw&quot; </i>quite pathetically. Its an excellent utility familiar though, because it can turn invisible in shadows, fly, and the Twilight can see through its eyes like beast-master.<br /> <br /> The NPC Twilight (its a coincidence) has two Neomah sexy secretaries but he's too Byronic Hero Broody Black Moods Grim Tortured Artist to have sex with them. He only cares about crafting and art. He uses them (and a cadre of Blood Apes) to kill anyone who wants to hurt him or tries to rob him for his frankly <i><u><b>ludicrous</b></u></i> wealth. He calls them Isqa and Eska. The blood apes are decked out in custom heavy armor. <br /> <br /> The Dawn has a giant Chow-Chow dog named Saffron, who has three powers: Flame Breath, Thunder Bark, and Size Change. Saffron take up any size from a lap dog to a small elephant. Saffron is a beautiful gradient of Red-Vermillion-Golden Wheat. He's a little bit showy and lazy. His favorite place to sleep is directly on the dawn's face.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":8830,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","user":"Sorcerous Overlord","date":". 05-15-2020, 04:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T04:45:00-07:00","id":1388650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1387122-cool-familiar-ideas?p=1388600#post1388600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My circle has [...] so they could <i>start an Exalted Jurassic Park</i>. [...] This is why I drink. <br /> <br /> [...] a trained Crow named <b>Crowley</b>, who can turn invisible [...] sunk deep into Avian Depression. <br /> <br /> [...]His favorite place to sleep is directly on the dawn's face.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the most Exalted thing I have read about Familiars. Period.<br /> <br /> And as I just read about a winged elemental the size of a castle, that is a pretty high bar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 05-15-2020, 09:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}